HyPortal
https://github.com/KBXBOTS/hyportal-

HyPortal is an unofficial, community-built launcher. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or associated with Hypixel Studios or Riot Games.

Hytale must be purchased and installed through official channels. HyPortal does
not bundle, download, or redistribute any Hytale game or server files. It only
launches software that is already installed on the user's machine, and it runs
the Hytale server that ships with that installation.

HyPortal does not read the official launcher's stored credentials, and does not
reuse the official launcher's OAuth client identity.

"Hytale" and "Hypixel Studios" are trademarks of their respective owners. Their
use here is nominative, to identify the software HyPortal works with.

If a rights holder wishes this project changed or taken down, please open an
issue on the repository above and it will be honoured.
